{"title": "Stuffed Bear (Container)", "pageid": 8826, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Stuffed_Bear_(Container)", "categories": ["Containers", "Common items", "Stuffed Animals"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:MISC_Stuffed_Bear_Clean_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/19/MISC_Stuffed_Bear_Clean_Faded.png/300px-MISC_Stuffed_Bear_Clean_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/1/19/MISC_Stuffed_Bear_Clean_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stuffed Bear (Container) image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/19/MISC_Stuffed_Bear_Clean_Faded.png/300px-MISC_Stuffed_Bear_Clean_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/19/MISC_Stuffed_Bear_Clean_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Stuffed Bear</b> is a common <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous</a> item. It is a stuffed bear that contains a note, and can be used as a <a href=\"/wiki/Containers\" title=\"Containers\">Container</a>, like a <a href=\"/wiki/Backpack\" title=\"Backpack\">Backpack</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>A knitted toy bear stuffed with soft fur.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Containers\" title=\"Containers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Containers_Icon.png/25px-Containers_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c2/Containers_Icon.png/38px-Containers_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c2/Containers_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Containers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Containers_Icon.png/25px-Containers_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c2/Containers_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Containers\" title=\"Containers\">Containers</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.10 kg (0.2 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.10 kg (0.2 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 16 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  16  gp</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Can be found in the <a href=\"/wiki/Sunlit_Wetlands\" title=\"Sunlit Wetlands\">Sunlit Wetlands</a> in the northern edge of a patch of shallow water at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;82&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;318</span>.</li></ul>\n</div>      \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The Stuffed Bear contains a <a href=\"/wiki/Muddy_Note\" title=\"Muddy Note\">Muddy Note</a>.</li>\n<li>This item can be useful for organizing the player's inventory because it is visually distinct from other <a href=\"/wiki/Containers\" title=\"Containers\">Containers</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t<li class=\"gallerycaption\">Stuffed Bear container in the Sunlit Wetlands.</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 356.66666666667px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 354.66666666667px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Stuffed_Bear_Bog.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Stuffed_Bear_Bog.png/532px-Stuffed_Bear_Bog.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Stuffed_Bear_Bog.png/798px-Stuffed_Bear_Bog.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/1/1b/Stuffed_Bear_Bog.png 2x\"><img alt=\"A stuffed bear in the Sunlit Wetlands.\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Stuffed_Bear_Bog.png/532px-Stuffed_Bear_Bog.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"355\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1b/Stuffed_Bear_Bog.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"></div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203252\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.035 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.037 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 954/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 9106/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2432/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 17/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 984/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 691474/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   28.835      1 Template:Misc_item_page\n100.00%   28.835      1 -total\n 27.44%    7.912      1 Template:Main_only\n 27.43%    7.908      4 Template:Icon_text\n 20.09%    5.793      8 Template:Trim\n 